Run 5 — deploy-kit image size fix, verified against final HEAD (25e4a2e)
================================================================================
Context: docs/evidence/deploy-kit-2026-09-05.log (run 4) measured 4.49GB and
named the real fix as out of that lane's permitted paths: apps/server has no
compile step and runs its TypeScript source directly via tsx, a
devDependency, so the runtime image had to ship the full monorepo
`pnpm install` (devDependencies included) rather than a prod-only one.

FIX (commit 5d9c5f0): moved tsx/typescript from apps/server's devDependencies
to dependencies; Dockerfile's runtime stage now installs via a new
`prod-deps` stage (`pnpm install --prod --frozen-lockfile --filter
"@sotto/server..."`, resolving to server + core + content, excluding the
much larger apps/client and packages/voice trees) instead of copying the
full monorepo install.

VERIFICATION (this log): built from a clean `git archive HEAD` of the final
run-5 commit (25e4a2e, after all four lanes and the i18n completeness fix
landed), not the shared working tree, which carries unrelated in-flight
content work.

